(text "K1 coil: about 21.1 mA at 5 V per channel.\n50 coils: ~1.06 A nominal, ~1.24 A at +5% rail / -10% resistance.\nUse a separate regulated 5 V, >=1.5 A relay supply for 50 channels.\nAnalog: ~150 mA typical for 150 active sections; budget full quads.\nNo coil PWM; keep relay heat and coil wiring away from R1-R6/C1." (at 220.98 228.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.016 1.016)) (justify left top)) (uuid "51c09447-52ef-5922-b23f-eb9a0d4fd954"))
